  "decision_conditions": [
    "The change of use to the first floor for two self-contained flats hereby permitted shall be used for Class C3 dwellinghouse(s) only,  each for a studio flat (one bed one person) occupancy only, notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any Order revoking or re-enacting that Order with or without modification), no development within Schedule 2, Part 3, Class L shall take place.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: Design and Access Statement and Fire Strategy received 04/03/2024;Reasonable Exception Statement received 08/11/2024;Location Plan received 04/03/2024;Block Plan entitled Drawing No: 23/3589/2:Proposed Floor Plan entitled Drawing No: 23/3589/4:Proposed Elevations Plan entitled Drawing No: 23/3589/6:CIL Form received 28/09/2023;",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external staircase, entrance gates, railing, insertion of external door and/or any making good of external walls, hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building and/or specified materials within the submission documents.",
    "The development hereby permitted shall not commence until the storage and disposal of refuse and recycling to provide a minimum of 4.No. 240 litre wheelie bins for residential refuse and recycling has been completed in accordance with the approved details (entitled Drawing No: 23/3589/4 and shall thereafter be retained.  The refuse bins shall be stored at all times, other than on collection days, in the designated refuse storage area, as shown on the approved drawing.",
    "Prior to occupation of the development hereby permitted, measures to minimize the risk of crime in a visually acceptable manner and meet the specific security needs of the application site/development shall be installed. Any such measures should follow the design principles set out in the relevant Design Guides on the Secured by Design website: http://www.securedbydesign.com/guides/index.aspx and shall include the following requirements:The proposed cycle storage will need to be purpose built tested and certified cycle stores, or built to Secured By Design specifications;The proposed refuse store at the front/side will need to be lockable;The proposed entrance gate at the front/side will need to be lockable;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall\nbe begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission."
  ],
